<title>TURKEY: Turkish Tupras sells Swiss firm 15,000 T naphtha.</title>
<headline>Turkish Tupras sells Swiss firm 15,000 T naphtha.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state refinery Tupras sold 14,000 to 15,000 tonnes of naphtha through a tender to Tempo of Geneva with a premium of $6.01 per tonne, Tupras said in a statement.</p>
<p>The FOB shipment will be on April 3-5 from Aliaga refinery, it said.</p>
<p>The tender was held on March 17, it said.</p>
<p>-- Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
